OL,3,GNEWSADog swim brings 'memorable' pool
OL,4,Aseason to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 200 dogs have been part of
OL,7,Fthe "rare opportunity" to enjoy an
OL,8,Foutdoor pool before it closed for the
OL,9,Fwinter.
OL,11,FOxford's Hinksey Outdoor Pool said its
OL,12,Fsummer season had been brought to "a
OL,13,Fmemorable close" with its first-ever
OL,14,Fdog swim on Sunday.
OL,16,FIt said dogs of all breeds and sizes
OL,17,Fhad taken to the water and hopes to
OL,18,Fbring the dog swim back next year.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
