OL,3,GNEWSADog swim brings 'memorable' pool
OL,4,Aseason to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames Ewart from Leisure Solutions
OL,7,FCommunity Trust, which manages the
OL,8,Fvenue in partnership with Serco
OL,9,FLeisure, said the event had created "a
OL,10,Fbrilliant atmosphere and was a great
OL,11,Fway to celebrate another successful
OL,12,Fseason at the pool".
